<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Acid Swirl</h1>
<p>Sphere: Acid Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 180)
Mana: 38
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast acid swirl &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast acid swirl</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster waves both hands at the target and screeches 'Bolat causter!', 
and a whirlpool of acid swirls around them. It is the strongest of the 
acid spells: the better your magic and your acid sphere, the more it 
burns. It does best against clothes and light leather, less well against 
heavier armour, and a shield softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
